  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-01f5610a28ee2f47de7c7a37",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于大多数系统，闭环稳定性与开环频率响应之间存在简单关系：在相角 ∠G(jω) = -180° 的频率处，若增加增益会导致不稳定，则幅值 |KG(jω)| 小于 1 表示稳定；若增加增益使系统由不稳定转为稳定，则幅值大于 1 表示稳定。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For most systems, a simple relationship exists between closed-loop stability and the open-loop frequency response: at the frequency where the phase ∠G(jω) = -180°, the magnitude |KG(jω)| being less than 1 indicates stability (if increasing gain leads to instability), and greater than 1 indicates stability (if increasing gain leads from instability to stability).",
